
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>HelpOld — Acessibilidade Digital</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Sora:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=Lora:ital,wght@0,400;0,600;1,400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #f5f0e8;
    --bg2: #ece6d8;
    --surface: #fff8ef;
    --text: #1a1209;
    --text2: #4a3f2e;
    --text3: #7a6e5e;
    --accent: #d4650a;
    --accent2: #e8922e;
    --accent-light: #fff0e0;
    --green: #2e7d5e;
    --green-light: #e8f5ef;
    --blue: #1a5f9e;
    --blue-light: #e0edf8;
    --border: #d4c9b0;
    --radius: 16px;
    --shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(60,30,0,0.10);
    --font-size-base: 18px;
    --focus-color: #d4650a;
  }
  [data-theme="dark"] {
    --bg: #1a1209;
    --bg2: #231a0e;
    --surface: #2c2015;
    --text: #f5ede0;
    --text2: #c9b89a;
    --text3: #8a7a65;
    --accent: #e8922e;
    --accent2: #f0a850;
    --accent-light: #3a2210;
    --green: #4aaa80;
    --green-light: #0e2a1e;
    --blue: #4a90d8;
    --blue-light: #0e1e2e;
    --border: #3a2e1e;
    --surface: #2a1e10;
  }
  [data-contrast="high"] {
    --bg: #000;
    --bg2: #111;
    --surface: #000;
    --text: #fff;
    --text2: #ffe066;
    --text3: #aaa;
    --accent: #ffe066;
    --accent2: #ffd000;
    --accent-light: #222;
    --green: #00ff88;
    --green-light: #002210;
    --blue: #66ccff;
    --blue-light: #001a2e;
    --border: #ffe066;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  html { font-size: var(--font-size-base); scroll-behavior: smooth; }
  body {
    font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif;
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--text);
    line-height: 1.7;
    transition: background 0.3s, color 0.3s;
  }
  *:focus-visible {
    outline: 3px solid var(--focus-color);
    outline-offset: 3px;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }

  /* ── SKIP LINK ── */
  .skip-link {
    position: absolute;
    top: -100px;
    left: 1rem;
    background: var(--accent);
    color: #fff;
    padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-weight: 600;
    z-index: 9999;
    transition: top 0.2s;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .skip-link:focus { top: 1rem; }

  /* ── ACCESSIBILITY BAR ── */
  #a11y-bar {
    background: var(--bg2);
    border-bottom: 1.5px solid var(--border);
    padding: 0.5rem 2rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    z-index: 100;
    backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
  }
  #a11y-bar span {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--text3);
    font-weight: 500;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    margin-right: 0.5rem;
  }
  .a11y-btn {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1.5px solid var(--border);
    color: var(--text);
    padding: 0.4rem 0.9rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 500;
    cursor: pointer;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    transition: all 0.18s;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .a11y-btn:hover, .a11y-btn.active {
    background: var(--accent);
    color: #fff;
    border-color: var(--accent);
  }
  .a11y-btn svg { width: 16px; height: 16px; flex-shrink: 0; }
  #tts-status {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--green);
    font-weight: 600;
    display: none;
    animation: pulse 1.5s infinite;
  }
  @keyframes pulse { 0%,100%{opacity:1} 50%{opacity:0.5} }

  /* ── HEADER ── */
  header {
    background: var(--surface);
    border-bottom: 1.5px solid var(--border);
    padding: 1.2rem 2rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1rem;
  }
  .logo {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .logo-icon {
    width: 48px; height: 48px;
    background: var(--accent);
    border-radius: 14px;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  }
  .logo-icon svg { width: 28px; height: 28px; color: #fff; }
  .logo-text { line-height: 1.2; }
  .logo-text strong { font-size: 1.4rem; font-weight: 700; display: block; }
  .logo-text small { font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--text3); }
  nav { display: flex; gap: 0.5rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  nav a {
    color: var(--text2);
    text-decoration: none;
    padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    transition: all 0.18s;
  }
  nav a:hover { background: var(--accent-light); color: var(--accent); }

  /* ── HERO ── */
  #hero {
    padding: 5rem 2rem 4rem;
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 4rem;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .hero-badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    background: var(--accent-light);
    color: var(--accent);
    border: 1.5px solid var(--accent);
    padding: 0.35rem 1rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  }
  h1 {
    font-family: 'Lora', serif;
    font-size: 3.2rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.15;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  h1 em { font-style: italic; color: var(--accent); }
  .hero-desc {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--text2);
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }
  .hero-cta {
    display: flex; gap: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .btn-primary {
    background: var(--accent);
    color: #fff;
    border: none;
    padding: 0.9rem 2rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 600;
    cursor: pointer;
    text-decoration: none;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    transition: all 0.2s;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(212,101,10,0.3);
  }
  .btn-primary:hover { background: var(--accent2); transform: translateY(-2px); }
  .btn-secondary {
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--text);
    border: 1.5px solid var(--border);
    padding: 0.9rem 2rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 500;
    cursor: pointer;
    text-decoration: none;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }
  .btn-secondary:hover { border-color: var(--accent); color: var(--accent); }
  .hero-visual {
    background: var(--bg2);
    border-radius: 24px;
    border: 1.5px solid var(--border);
    padding: 2rem;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
  }
  .stats-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .stat-card {
    background: var(--surface);
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 1.2rem;
    border: 1.5px solid var(--border);
    text-align: center;
  }
  .stat-card .num {
    font-family: 'Lora', serif;
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--accent);
    display: block;
  }
  .stat-card .lbl {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--text3);
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .progress-item { margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .progress-label {
    display: flex; justify-content: space-between;
    font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text2); margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
  }
  .progress-bar {
    height: 8px; background: var(--bg);
    border-radius: 999px; overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .progress-fill {
    height: 100%; border-radius: 999px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--accent), var(--accent2));
    transition: width 1.5s ease;
  }

  /* ── SECTION ── */
  section { padding: 4rem 2rem; }
  .section-inner { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .section-label {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
  h2 {
    font-family: 'Lora', serif;
    font-size: 2.2rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.25;
  }
  .section-desc { color: var(--text2); font-size: 1.05rem; max-width: 620px; }

  /* ── FEATURES ── */
  #features { background: var(--surface); }
  .features-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-top: 3rem;
  }
  .feature-card {
    background: var(--bg);
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 2rem;
    border: 1.5px solid var(--border);
    transition: all 0.2s;
    cursor: default;
  }
  .feature-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    border-color: var(--accent);
  }
  .feat-icon {
    width: 52px; height: 52px;
    border-radius: 14px;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
  }
  .feat-icon.orange { background: var(--accent-light); color: var(--accent); }
  .feat-icon.green { background: var(--green-light); color: var(--green); }
  .feat-icon.blue { background: var(--blue-light); color: var(--blue); }
  .feature-card h3 { font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 0.6rem; }
  .feature-card p { font-size: 0.92rem; color: var(--text2); line-height: 1.7; }

  /* ── DEMO ── */
  #demo { background: var(--bg2); }
  .demo-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 3rem;
    margin-top: 3rem;
    align-items: start;
  }
  .demo-controls { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.5rem; }
  .demo-control {
    background: var(--surface);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border: 1.5px solid var(--border);
  }
  .demo-control h3 { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  .demo-control p { font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text2); margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .slider-row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1rem; }
  .slider-row input[type=range] {
    flex: 1;
    accent-color: var(--accent);
    height: 6px;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .slider-val {
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--accent);
    min-width: 40px;
    text-align: right;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }
  .demo-preview {
    background: var(--surface);
    border-radius: 20px;
    border: 1.5px solid var(--border);
    padding: 2rem;
    min-height: 400px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    position: sticky;
    top: 80px;
  }
  .preview-text { transition: font-size 0.3s; }
  .preview-title {
    font-family: 'Lora', serif;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .preview-body { color: var(--text2); line-height: 1.8; }
  .tts-area {
    background: var(--bg2);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 1rem;
    border: 1.5px solid var(--border);
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }
  .tts-area:hover { border-color: var(--accent); }
  .tts-hint { font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--text3); margin-top: 0.5rem; text-align: center; }

  /* ── WCAG TABLE ── */
  #wcag { background: var(--surface); }
  .wcag-table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin-top: 2rem;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
  }
  .wcag-table th {
    background: var(--bg2);
    padding: 1rem;
    text-align: left;
    font-weight: 600;
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border);
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .wcag-table td {
    padding: 1rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    color: var(--text2);
    vertical-align: top;
  }
  .wcag-table tr:hover td { background: var(--bg2); }
  .badge {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.2rem 0.7rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .badge-green { background: var(--green-light); color: var(--green); }
  .badge-orange { background: var(--accent-light); color: var(--accent); }
  .badge-blue { background: var(--blue-light); color: var(--blue); }

  /* ── ABOUT ── */
  #about { background: var(--bg2); }
  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 4rem;
    align-items: center;
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }
  .about-list { list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; }
  .about-list li {
    display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--text2);
  }
  .about-list li span.check {
    width: 22px; height: 22px;
    background: var(--green-light);
    color: var(--green);
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }
  .tech-stack {
    display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.75rem; margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }
  .tech-tag {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1.5px solid var(--border);
    padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--text2);
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.4rem;
  }

  /* ── FOOTER ── */
  footer {
    background: var(--text);
    color: var(--bg2);
    padding: 3rem 2rem;
    text-align: center;
  }
  footer a { color: var(--accent2); text-decoration: none; }
  footer p { margin-top: 0.5rem; font-size: 0.9rem; opacity: 0.7; }

  /* ── RESPONSIVE ── */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    #hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 2rem; padding: 3rem 1.5rem; }
    h1 { font-size: 2.2rem; }
    .demo-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .about-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    nav { display: none; }
    #a11y-bar { padding: 0.5rem 1rem; }
  }

  /* ── TTS HIGHLIGHT ── */
  .tts-reading { background: rgba(212,101,10,0.15); border-radius: 4px; }

  /* ── ANIMATIONS ── */
  @keyframes fadeUp {
    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px); }
    to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  }
  .fade-up { animation: fadeUp 0.6s ease forwards; }
  .fade-up:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: 0.1s; }
  .fade-up:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: 0.2s; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<a href="#main" class="skip-link">Pular para o conteúdo principal</a>

<!-- ACCESSIBILITY BAR -->
<div id="a11y-bar" role="toolbar" aria-label="Barra de acessibilidade">
  <span>Acessibilidade:</span>

  <button class="a11y-btn" id="btn-font-dec" aria-label="Diminuir fonte" title="Diminuir tamanho da fonte">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" aria-hidden="true"><text x="4" y="18" font-size="14" fill="currentColor" stroke="none">A</text><text x="13" y="20" font-size="10" fill="currentColor" stroke="none">A</text></svg>
    Diminuir
  </button>

  <button class="a11y-btn" id="btn-font-inc" aria-label="Aumentar fonte" title="Aumentar tamanho da fonte">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><text x="2" y="18" font-size="10" fill="currentColor" stroke="none">A</text><text x="11" y="20" font-size="15" fill="currentColor" stroke="none">A</text></svg>
    Aumentar
  </button>

  <button class="a11y-btn" id="btn-contrast" aria-label="Ativar ou desativar alto contraste" title="Alto contraste">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 3v18" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M12 3a9 9 0 0 1 0 18" fill="currentColor"/></svg>
    Contraste
  </button>

  <button class="a11y-btn" id="btn-dark" aria-label="Alternar modo escuro" title="Modo escuro">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 12.79A9 9 0 1 1 11.21 3a7 7 0 0 0 9.79 9.79z"/></svg>
    Escuro
  </button>

  <button class="a11y-btn" id="btn-tts" aria-label="Ativar leitura de tela" title="Leitura de texto">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M11 5 6 9H2v6h4l5 4V5z"/><path d="M19.07 4.93a10 10 0 0 1 0 14.14"/><path d="M15.54 8.46a5 5 0 0 1 0 7.07"/></svg>
    Leitura
  </button>

  <button class="a11y-btn" id="btn-reset" aria-label="Redefinir configurações de acessibilidade">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 12a9 9 0 1 0 9-9 9.75 9.75 0 0 0-6.74 2.74L3 8"/><path d="M3 3v5h5"/></svg>
    Redefinir
  </button>

  <span id="tts-status" aria-live="polite">🔊 Lendo...</span>
</div>

<!-- HEADER -->
<header role="banner">
  <a href="#" class="logo" aria-label="HelpOld — página inicial">
    <div class="logo-icon" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
        <path d="M20.84 4.61a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 0L12 5.67l-1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 7.78l1.06 1.06L12 21.23l7.78-7.78 1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0 0-7.78z"/>
      </svg>
    </div>
    <div class="logo-text">
      <strong>HelpOld</strong>
      <small>Acessibilidade Digital</small>
    </div>
  </a>
  <nav aria-label="Navegação principal">
    <a href="#features">Recursos</a>
    <a href="#demo">Demonstração</a>
    <a href="#wcag">WCAG</a>
    <a href="#about">Sobre</a>
  </nav>
</header>

<!-- MAIN -->
<main id="main">

  <!-- HERO -->
  <section aria-labelledby="hero-title">
    <div id="hero">
      <div>
        <div class="hero-badge" aria-label="Projeto acadêmico de acessibilidade">
          <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/></svg>
          Projeto de Acessibilidade Web
        </div>
        <h1 id="hero-title">
          A internet<br>para <em>todas</em> as pessoas
        </h1>
        <p class="hero-desc">
          O HelpOld é um projeto que demonstra soluções de acessibilidade digital aplicadas à programação web, promovendo inclusão para idosos, pessoas com deficiência visual, auditiva e motora.
        </p>
        <div class="hero-cta">
          <a href="#demo" class="btn-primary" aria-label="Explorar a demonstração de acessibilidade">
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><polygon points="10 8 16 12 10 16 10 8"/></svg>
            Ver Demonstração
          </a>
          <a href="#features" class="btn-secondary" aria-label="Conhecer os recursos de acessibilidade">
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9 18l6-6-6-6"/></svg>
            Recursos
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-visual" aria-label="Estatísticas de acessibilidade">
        <div class="stats-grid">
          <div class="stat-card">
            <span class="num">1.3bi</span>
            <span class="lbl">Pessoas com deficiência no mundo</span>
          </div>
          <div class="stat-card">
            <span class="num">97%</span>
            <span class="lbl">Sites com falhas de acessibilidade</span>
          </div>
        </div>
